    "body": "```\r\ngit status --porcelain=2 --branch\r\n\r\n# branch.oid ee460fd9ab1a86b8b5d5994611fd679dfb9c2f47\r\n# branch.head develop\r\n# branch.upstream origin/develop\r\n# branch.ab +0 -0\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\nSTARSHIP_LOG=\"trace\" starship module git_status\r\n\r\n[DEBUG] - (starship::config): STARSHIP_CONFIG is not set\r\n[DEBUG] - (starship::config): Using default config path: /Users/srg/.config/starship.toml\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::config): Config file content: \"\r\n[package]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n\"\r\n[DEBUG] - (starship::config): Config parsed: Table({\"package\": Table({\"disabled\": Boolean(true)})})\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::config): No config found for \"git_status\": Option \"git_status\" not found\r\n[DEBUG] - (starship::modules::git_status): New repo status created\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::config): Parsing color_string: red\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::config): Read predefined color: red\r\n[TRACE] - (starship::modules): Took 423.33289ms to compute module \"git_status\"\r\n[✘] %\r\n```",
